        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adrift in the endless void, the captain and crew cling to survival aboard a failing spaceship. Their only hope? Recover a crucial <strong><i>Astronavigator Core</i></strong> before the ship succumbs to the darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIVE CREW MEMBERS (and a clone). ONE MISSION.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299100/extras/30459b7834f35ab828a62ddf3e9128f2.avif?t=1766646124\" width=616 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the crew: <strong>Captain</strong>, <strong>Commander</strong>, <strong>Recon</strong>, <strong>Engineer</strong>, <strong>Disciple</strong>. Each crew member brings unique strengths, but all are fragile in the face of death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To avoid unnecessary losses, the captain can send <strong>humanoid clones</strong> instead—expendable, but at a cost. Every clone drains <i>Ionite</i>, the rare energy source keeping the ship operational. Run out, and the crew will have no choice but to risk their own lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How far will you go to keep your crew alive?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A HIGH-STAKES ACTION PLATFORMER</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices Matter.</strong> Losing a crew member is permanent. Every decision counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Fluid Movement.</strong> Simple controls—<strong>jump, dash, </strong>and<strong> channel energy</strong>—that evolve into intricate, parkour-like maneuvers as you improve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299100/extras/f0f020bc450faa19ac0a68cbe6d5ba3e.poster.avif?t=1766646124\" width=720 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299100/extras/f0f020bc450faa19ac0a68cbe6d5ba3e.webm?t=1766646124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299100/extras/f0f020bc450faa19ac0a68cbe6d5ba3e.mp4?t=1766646124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Dash-Attack Combat.</strong> There is no attack button. Dash through energy to recharge movement and power up your weapons. Every fight is a test of momentum and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299100/extras/0ac78121c900afc3950c2cf26dac94f7.poster.avif?t=1766646124\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299100/extras/0ac78121c900afc3950c2cf26dac94f7.webm?t=1766646124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299100/extras/0ac78121c900afc3950c2cf26dac94f7.mp4?t=1766646124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct Combat Styles. </strong>Each crew member wields two unique weapons, shaping how they fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Captain strikes from afar with tactical orbital bombardments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299100/extras/8c6972eeb8ad0a8f4a307356aa009bae.poster.avif?t=1766646124\" width=800 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299100/extras/8c6972eeb8ad0a8f4a307356aa009bae.webm?t=1766646124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299100/extras/8c6972eeb8ad0a8f4a307356aa009bae.mp4?t=1766646124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Commander dominates close-quarters combat with brute force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299100/extras/f8dcb417d0006460d5662f74d2b17e1c.poster.avif?t=1766646124\" width=800 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299100/extras/f8dcb417d0006460d5662f74d2b17e1c.webm?t=1766646124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299100/extras/f8dcb417d0006460d5662f74d2b17e1c.mp4?t=1766646124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Recon relies on speed, stealth, and hit-and-run tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299100/extras/2d1194460ff6d4e631b6e2b869cc2b26.poster.avif?t=1766646124\" width=800 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299100/extras/2d1194460ff6d4e631b6e2b869cc2b26.webm?t=1766646124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299100/extras/2d1194460ff6d4e631b6e2b869cc2b26.mp4?t=1766646124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Engineer delivers calculated, high-damage strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299100/extras/831ee4dbf2a0bd622f8b6b829f69af38.poster.avif?t=1766646124\" width=800 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299100/extras/831ee4dbf2a0bd622f8b6b829f69af38.webm?t=1766646124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299100/extras/831ee4dbf2a0bd622f8b6b829f69af38.mp4?t=1766646124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Disciple controls the battlefield with devastating area attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299100/extras/f28a2f39c0157af925c1759dc1d34357.poster.avif?t=1766646124\" width=800 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299100/extras/f28a2f39c0157af925c1759dc1d34357.webm?t=1766646124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299100/extras/f28a2f39c0157af925c1759dc1d34357.mp4?t=1766646124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This ship has seen its share of storms, but it’s not the ship that survives—it’s the crew. Let’s bring her home.</i></p>",
